+the cyclic coset generated by a relative permutation, enumerates all n powers,
+classifies every supplied matching, and verifies a missing coset element.  The
+paper's uniform sampler is a slower expected Theta_k(n^k)-trial fallback.  The
+compact route notices which two displayed permutations are the canonical
+consecutive generators and composes only their third relative power: five
