+        "an expected Theta_k(n^k)-trial algorithm for fixed k, while the "
+        "shipping instance's exact cyclic-coset reference algorithm is "
+        "operation-counted and timed in G5/G6; recognizing one relative cycle "
+        "and locating the required edge reduces the route to five length-n "
+        "permutation passes."
